{
  "slug": "extract-alpha",
  "name": "Extract Alpha",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Remove backgrounds from AI-generated images using two-pass difference matting. Generate the same image on white and black backgrounds, then mathematically extract pixel-perfect transparency — no AI guessing, no edge artifacts.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 skills**, `extract` (Remove background from AI-generated (e.g), `prompt` (Generate a pair of AI image prompts (white + black background) ready for alpha extraction).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install extract-alpha@claude-community` from `furic/extract-alpha`.",
